msgstr "Социално споделяне е налично в MetaSlider Lightbox Pro"

#: dist/ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3854
#: dist/ml-slider-lightbox/ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3854
