msgstr "Hash URL адреси са налични в MetaSlider Lightbox Pro"

#: dist/ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3875
#: dist/ml-slider-lightbox/ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3875
msgid "Autoplay is available in MetaSlider Lightbox Pro"
msgstr "Автоматично възпроизвеждане е налично в MetaSlider Lightbox Pro"

#: dist/ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3973
#: dist/ml-slider-lightbox/ml-slider-lightbox/class-ml-slider-lightbox.php:3973
